msgstr "Kokoro nije instaliran. Instalirajte paket biglinux-kokoro-tts."

msgid "The Kokoro voice model is missing. Reinstall the biglinux-kokoro-tts package."
msgstr "Nedostaje Kokoro glasovni model. Ponovno instalirajte paket biglinux-kokoro-tts."

msgid "No Kokoro voices were found. Open the Voice Manager to download a voice."
msgstr "Nisu pronađeni Kokoro glasovi. Otvorite Upravitelj glasova da preuzmete glas."

msgid "This Kokoro voice is not installed. Open the Voice Manager to download it."
msgstr "Ovaj Kokoro glas nije instaliran. Otvorite Upravitelj glasova da ga preuzmete."

